      "score": 4,
      "rationale": "The proposal is well-structured, cleanly differentiates from ReinFix (mechanism confirmed independently), and the core ablation design (same model, same corpus, same encoder, varying only retrieval key) is methodologically tight. The ASE 2026 NIER track deadline (May 12) is listed as a target but has effectively already passed, suggesting the venue list was not updated carefully."
