    "LOW — The proposal does not specify which encoding model will be used for FTCR. ReinFix uses text-embedding-3-large (OpenAI API). If FTCR uses the same encoder for fair comparison, this imposes an ongoing API cost not captured in the GPU-hour budget. If using CodeBERT or UniXcoder instead, the encoder comparison is confounded with the hard/soft partitioning comparison. This should be clarified explicitly."
