  "reason": "Substantial improvements from Round 1, but a confirmed citation error (ICSE 2025 vs 2026) and unaddressed corpus sparsity problem (~31 Java pairs/type) make the paper unsubmission-ready; the EMNLP NLP contribution framing remains weak."
}
